<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>RareLink · 희귀질환 통합 협진 플랫폼</title>
<style>
:root {
  --bg: #f5f7fb; --panel: #fff; --text: #1f2937; --muted: #6b7280; --line: #e5e7eb; --soft: #f3f4f6;
  --blue: #2563eb; --green: #10b981; --amber: #f59e0b; --red: #dc2626; --purple: #7c3aed; --teal: #0d9488;
}
body.dark {
  --bg: #111827; --panel: #1f2937; --text: #f9fafb; --muted: #9ca3af; --line: #374151; --soft: #273449;
  --blue: #60a5fa; --green: #34d399; --amber: #fbbf24; --red: #f87171; --purple: #a78bfa; --teal: #2dd4bf;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body { margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Noto Sans KR", sans-serif; }
.container { max-width: 1680px; margin: auto; padding: 20px; }
.header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--line); padding-bottom: 16px; margin-bottom: 18px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.header h1 { font-size: 25px; margin: 0 0 6px; }
.header p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
.header-actions { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }
button, input, select, textarea { font: inherit; }
.btn { border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--panel); color: var(--text); padding: 8px 11px; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; }
.btn:hover { filter: brightness(.97); }
.btn:disabled { opacity: .5; cursor: not-allowed; }
.btn:focus-visible, .tab-btn:focus-visible, .case-item:focus-visible, input:focus-visible, select:focus-visible, textarea:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--blue); outline-offset: 2px; }
.btn-primary { background: var(--blue); border-color: var(--blue); color: #fff; }
.btn-success { background: var(--green); border-color: var(--green); color: #fff; }
.btn-danger { background: var(--red); border-color: var(--red); color: #fff; }
.btn-ghost { background: var(--soft); }
.btn-sm { padding: 5px 8px; font-size: 11px; border-radius: 6px; }
.link-btn { border: none; background: none; color: var(--blue); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; cursor: pointer; padding: 0; }
.fb-status { display: inline-block; margin-top: 6px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--soft); border: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--muted); }
.fb-status.ok { color: var(--green); border-color: var(--green); }
.fb-status.warn { color: var(--amber); border-color: var(--amber); }
.fb-status.fail { color: var(--red); border-color: var(--red); }
.inbox-badge { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--red); color: #fff; border: none; cursor: pointer; }
.inbox-badge.zero { background: var(--soft); color: var(--muted); border: 1px solid var(--line); }
.tab-nav { display: flex; gap: 8px; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.tab-btn { border: 1px solid transparent; background: transparent; color: var(--text); padding: 8px 13px; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; }
.tab-btn.active { background: var(--blue); color: #fff; border-color: var(--blue); }
.tab-btn:hover:not(.active) { background: var(--soft); }
.tab-content { display: none; }
.tab-content.active { display: block; }
.card { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.04); min-width: 0; }
.card h3 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 15px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.card h4 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 13px; }
.note { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); margin: 6px 0 0; line-height: 1.6; }
.empty { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); padding: 14px; text-align: center; background: var(--soft); border-radius: 8px; }
.grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
.grid-4 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 12px; }
.stack { display: grid; gap: 16px; }
.stat { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px 16px; }
.stat-label { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700; }
.stat-num { font-size: 30px; font-weight: 800; margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.1; }
.stat-sub { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 4px; }
.badge { display: inline-block; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; padding: 3px 7px; border-radius: 99px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--soft); color: var(--text); white-space: nowrap; }
.badge.b-open { border-color: var(--blue); color: var(--blue); }
.badge.b-mdt { border-color: var(--purple); color: var(--purple); }
.badge.b-done { border-color: var(--green); color: var(--green); }
.badge.b-urgent { border-color: var(--red); color: #fff; background: var(--red); }
.badge.b-wait { border-color: var(--amber); color: var(--text); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--amber) 18%, var(--panel)); }
.badge.b-lock { border-color: var(--teal); color: var(--teal); }
.chip { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--soft); color: var(--text); }
.chip .dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; flex: none; }
.chip.hit { border-color: var(--green); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--green) 12%, var(--panel)); }
.chip.miss { border-style: dashed; color: var(--muted); background: transparent; }
.chip .x { border: none; background: none; color: var(--muted); cursor: pointer; font-size: 12px; padding: 0 0 0 2px; line-height: 1; }
.chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }
.field { width: 100%; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--panel); color: var(--text); border-radius: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; font-size: 12px; }
textarea.field { resize: vertical; min-height: 64px; line-height: 1.5; }
.row { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.row > .grow { flex: 1; min-width: 140px; }
.form-label { display: block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; margin: 12px 0 6px; }

/* 케이스 보드 */
.board { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 300px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 16px; align-items: start; }
.case-list { display: grid; gap: 8px; max-height: calc(100vh - 260px); overflow-y: auto; padding-right: 2px; }
.case-item { text-align: left; width: 100%; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--panel); color: var(--text); border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px 11px; cursor: pointer; border-left: 4px solid var(--line); }
.case-item:hover { background: var(--soft); }
.case-item.active { border-color: var(--blue); border-left-color: var(--blue); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--blue) 6%, var(--panel)); }
.case-item.urgent { border-left-color: var(--red); }
.case-item .ci-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 6px; font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700; }
.case-item .ci-title { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; margin: 5px 0; line-height: 1.4; }
.case-item .ci-meta { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); }
.filter-row { display: flex; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 10px 0; }
.filter-btn { border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--panel); color: var(--text); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; padding: 5px 9px; border-radius: 99px; cursor: pointer; }
.filter-btn.on { background: var(--text); color: var(--panel); border-color: var(--text); }
.case-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.case-head h2 { margin: 6px 0 6px; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.35; }
.case-meta { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.question-box { margin-top: 12px; padding: 11px 13px; border-radius: 8px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--blue) 7%, var(--panel)); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--blue) 40%, var(--line)); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; }
.question-box strong { color: var(--blue); }
.odyssey { display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 12px; }
.odyssey div { background: var(--soft); border-radius: 8px; padding: 8px 12px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700; }
.odyssey b { display: block; font-size: 17px; color: var(--text); }
.detail-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.25fr); gap: 16px; margin-top: 16px; align-items: start; }

/* 진단 여정 */
.tl { position: relative; padding-left: 18px; }
.tl::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 5px; top: 4px; bottom: 4px; width: 2px; background: var(--line); }
.tl-item { position: relative; padding: 0 0 12px; }
.tl-item::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: -17px; top: 4px; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--panel); border: 2px solid var(--muted); }
.tl-item.now::before { border-color: var(--blue); background: var(--blue); }
.tl-date { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--muted); }
.tl-where { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; margin-top: 2px; }
.tl-what { font-size: 12px; margin-top: 2px; line-height: 1.5; }
.ex-item { display: flex; gap: 8px; font-size: 12px; padding: 7px 9px; background: var(--soft); border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 6px; line-height: 1.5; }
.ex-item s { font-weight: 800; color: var(--muted); white-space: nowrap; }
.kv { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px; }
.kv td { padding: 7px 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); vertical-align: top; }
.kv td:first-child { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700; width: 42%; }

/* 감별진단 보드 */
.cand { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 9px; padding: 12px; margin-top: 10px; background: var(--panel); }
.cand.top { border-color: var(--blue); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--blue) inset; }
.cand-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start; }
.cand-name { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; }
.cand-by { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 2px; }
.cand-pct { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; text-align: right; line-height: 1; }
.cand-pct small { display: block; font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700; margin-top: 3px; }
.bar { height: 7px; background: var(--soft); border-radius: 99px; overflow: hidden; margin: 9px 0 8px; border: 1px solid var(--line); }
.bar > div { height: 100%; border-radius: 99px; }
.votes { display: grid; gap: 5px; }
.vote { font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 6px 8px; background: var(--soft); border-radius: 6px; }
.vote .lv { font-weight: 800; }
.lv-3 { color: var(--red); } .lv-2 { color: var(--amber); } .lv-1 { color: var(--blue); } .lv-0 { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: line-through; }
.my-vote { display: flex; gap: 5px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; margin-top: 9px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted); }
.vbtn { border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--panel); color: var(--text); border-radius: 6px; padding: 4px 8px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; cursor: pointer; }
.vbtn.on { background: var(--text); color: var(--panel); border-color: var(--text); }
.next-test { margin-top: 8px; font-size: 11px; padding: 6px 8px; border-left: 3px solid var(--teal); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--teal) 8%, var(--panel)); border-radius: 4px; }
.agree { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 99px; margin-left: 6px; }
.agree.ok { color: var(--green); border: 1px solid var(--green); }
.agree.split { color: var(--red); border: 1px solid var(--red); }
.agree.mid { color: var(--amber); border: 1px solid var(--amber); }

/* 매칭 */
.match { padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
.match:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.match-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; align-items: center; }
.match-name { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; }
.match-sub { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); }
.match-score { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; }
.check-hint { font-size: 11px; margin-top: 6px; line-height: 1.6; }
.similar { margin-top: 10px; padding: 10px; background: var(--soft); border-radius: 8px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; }

/* 토론 */
.thread { display: grid; gap: 8px; max-height: 440px; overflow-y: auto; padding-right: 2px; }
.post { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 32px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 10px; }
.avatar { width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; }
.post-body { background: var(--soft); border-radius: 8px; padding: 9px 11px; }
.post-top { display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); }
.post-top b { color: var(--text); font-size: 12px; }
.post-text { font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.6; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; }
.post.sys .post-body { background: transparent; border: 1px dashed var(--line); }
.mention { color: var(--blue); font-weight: 800; }
.tag { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid var(--line); }
.tag-의견 { color: var(--blue); border-color: var(--blue); }
.tag-질문 { color: var(--amber); border-color: var(--amber); }
.tag-검사 { color: var(--teal); border-color: var(--teal); }
.tag-결론 { color: #fff; background: var(--green); border-color: var(--green); }
.tag-요청 { color: var(--purple); border-color: var(--purple); }
.composer { display: grid; gap: 8px; margin-top: 12px; }

/* 액션 */
.action { display: flex; gap: 9px; align-items: flex-start; padding: 8px 10px; background: var(--soft); border-radius: 7px; margin-top: 6px; font-size: 12px; }
.action input { width: 16px; height: 16px; margin-top: 1px; cursor: pointer; }
.action.done .action-text { text-decoration: line-through; color: var(--muted); }
.action-meta { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 2px; }
.action-meta .late { color: var(--red); font-weight: 800; }

/* 협진 요청 */
.consult { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-left: 4px solid var(--amber); border-radius: 8px; padding: 11px 12px; margin-top: 8px; background: var(--panel); }
.consult.urgent { border-left-color: var(--red); }
.consult.replied { border-left-color: var(--green); }
.consult-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700; }
.consult-q { font-size: 12px; margin: 6px 0; line-height: 1.6; }
.consult-reply { font-size: 12px; margin-top: 6px; padding: 8px 10px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--green) 9%, var(--panel)); border-radius: 6px; line-height: 1.6; }
.sla { font-weight: 800; }
.sla.over { color: var(--red); }
.consult-actions { display: flex; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 8px; }

/* 전문가 */
.experts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
.expert { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px; background: var(--panel); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
.expert.rec { border-color: var(--purple); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--purple) inset; }
.expert-top { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; }
.expert-name { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; }
.expert-dept { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); }
.expert-stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 6px; }
.expert-stats div { background: var(--soft); border-radius: 6px; padding: 6px; text-align: center; font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700; }
.expert-stats b { display: block; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text); }
.rec-why { font-size: 11px; color: var(--purple); font-weight: 700; }
.avail { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; }
.avail.on { color: var(--green); } .avail.busy { color: var(--amber); } .avail.off { color: var(--muted); }

/* 회의 */
.mdt { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px; background: var(--panel); margin-top: 10px; }
.mdt.done { opacity: .85; }
.mdt-when { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; }
.agenda { display: grid; gap: 6px; margin-top: 10px; }
.agenda-item { padding: 8px 10px; background: var(--soft); border-radius: 7px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; }
.conclusion { margin-top: 6px; padding: 7px 9px; border-left: 3px solid var(--green); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--green) 8%, var(--panel)); border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px; }
.check-list { display: grid; gap: 6px; max-height: 200px; overflow-y: auto; padding: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; }
.check-list label { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer; }

/* 라이브러리 */
.lib { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(340px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
.lib-card { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px; background: var(--panel); }
.lib-dx { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--green); margin: 4px 0; }
.lib-row { font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 6px; }
.lib-row b { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 800; margin-right: 4px; }

/* 로그 */
.table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; }
table.data { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px; }
table.data th { text-align: left; background: var(--soft); padding: 9px 10px; font-weight: 800; white-space: nowrap; }
table.data td { padding: 8px 10px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }

/* 모달 */
.modal-overlay { position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,.5); display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center; z-index: 999; padding: 20px; }
.modal-overlay.show { display: flex; }
.modal-box { background: var(--panel); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; max-width: 640px; width: 100%; max-height: 88vh; overflow-y: auto; box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.35); }
.modal-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
.modal-head h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 16px; }
.modal-foot { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 8px; margin-top: 16px; }
.form-error { color: var(--red); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 10px; min-height: 16px; }
.privacy-box { margin-top: 12px; padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--teal); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--teal) 7%, var(--panel)); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; }
.privacy-box label { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: flex-start; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }

/* 로그인 */
.login-screen { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; min-height: 100vh; background: var(--bg); padding: 20px; }
.login-card { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: 36px 32px; max-width: 420px; width: 100%; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.08); }
.login-title { text-align: center; font-size: 26px; margin: 0 0 6px; }
.login-sub { text-align: center; color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 26px; font-size: 13px; }
.login-label { display: block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 7px; }
.login-field { width: 100%; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--panel); color: var(--text); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
.login-error { color: var(--red); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; margin: -8px 0 12px; min-height: 16px; }
.login-hint { margin-top: 20px; padding: 12px; background: var(--soft); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7; }
.footer { text-align: center; font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 24px; padding: 14px; }
.toast { position: fixed; bottom: 22px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); background: var(--text); color: var(--panel); padding: 10px 16px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; z-index: 1000; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; transition: opacity .2s; }
.toast.show { opacity: 1; }

@media (max-width: 1250px) { .detail-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .grid-4 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
@media (max-width: 900px) { .board, .grid-2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .case-list { max-height: 320px; } }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { * { transition: none !important; animation: none !important; } }


/* ===== Clinical genetics + video collaboration integration ===== */
.clinical-hero { background: linear-gradient(135deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--blue) 92%, #1e3a8a), color-mix(in srgb, var(--purple) 72%, var(--blue))); color:#fff; border-radius:14px; padding:18px 20px; box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(37,99,235,.16); }
.clinical-hero h2 { margin:8px 0 5px; font-size:20px; line-height:1.35; }
.clinical-hero p { margin:0; font-size:12px; line-height:1.6; color:rgba(255,255,255,.86); }
.hero-badge { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; padding:4px 9px; border-radius:99px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.17); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25); font-size:10px; font-weight:800; }
.btn-white { background:#fff; color:#1d4ed8; border-color:#fff; }
.pipeline { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr); gap:6px; margin-top:14px; }
.pipe-step { text-align:center; min-width:0; }
.pipe-dot { width:30px; height:30px; margin:auto; border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:11px; font-weight:800; background:var(--soft); color:var(--muted); border:1px solid var(--line); }
.pipe-step.done .pipe-dot { background:var(--blue); border-color:var(--blue); color:#fff; }
.pipe-step.current .pipe-dot { box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb, var(--blue) 18%, transparent); }
.pipe-label { margin-top:5px; font-size:10px; color:var(--muted); font-weight:700; }
.review-row { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:10px; align-items:center; padding:9px 10px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:8px; margin-top:7px; background:var(--panel); font-size:12px; }
.clinical-team { display:grid; gap:6px; }
.team-row { display:flex; gap:9px; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; padding:8px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
.team-row:last-child { border-bottom:0; }
.team-avatar { width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:8px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:#fff; font-size:11px; font-weight:800; background:var(--blue); }
.gen-layout { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.65fr); gap:16px; align-items:start; }
.gen-variant { border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px; padding:12px; margin-top:8px; background:var(--panel); }
.gen-variant:first-child { margin-top:0; }
.variant-head { display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.variant-gene { font-size:16px; font-weight:900; color:var(--blue); }
.variant-code { font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace; font-size:11px; color:var(--muted); }
.variant-meta { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:6px; margin-top:10px; }
.variant-meta div { background:var(--soft); border-radius:7px; padding:7px; font-size:10px; color:var(--muted); }
.variant-meta b { display:block; margin-top:2px; color:var(--text); font-size:11px; }
.pedigree-stage { position:relative; height:510px; min-width:680px; background:var(--soft); border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden; border:1px solid var(--line); }
.pedigree-wrap { overflow-x:auto; }
.ped-node { position:absolute; transform:translate(-50%,-50%); border:0; background:transparent; cursor:pointer; color:var(--text); width:100px; padding:0; }
.ped-symbol { width:46px; height:46px; margin:auto; border:2px solid var(--muted); background:var(--panel); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:11px; font-weight:900; }
.ped-symbol.circle { border-radius:50%; }
.ped-symbol.square { border-radius:6px; }
.ped-symbol.affected { border-color:var(--purple); background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--purple) 13%,var(--panel)); }
.ped-symbol.patient { box-shadow:0 0 0 4px color-mix(in srgb,var(--blue) 18%,transparent); border-color:var(--blue); }
.ped-node.selected .ped-symbol { box-shadow:0 0 0 4px color-mix(in srgb,var(--blue) 22%,transparent); }
.ped-name { margin-top:4px; font-size:10px; font-weight:800; }
.ped-rel { font-size:9px; color:var(--muted); }
.ped-detail { position:sticky; top:12px; }
.video-shell { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 340px; gap:16px; align-items:start; }
.video-grid { min-height:480px; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:10px; background:#0f172a; padding:12px; border-radius:12px; }
.video-tile { position:relative; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; min-height:220px; border-radius:10px; background:#1e293b; color:#fff; overflow:hidden; }
.video-avatar { width:72px; height:72px; border-radius:50%; background:#2563eb; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:23px; font-weight:900; }
.video-name { position:absolute; left:10px; bottom:9px; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; }
.video-state { position:absolute; right:9px; top:9px; font-size:10px; color:#cbd5e1; }
.video-controls { display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-top:10px; }
.control-btn { width:42px; height:42px; border-radius:50%; border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--panel); color:var(--text); cursor:pointer; font-size:17px; }
.control-btn.off { color:#fff; background:var(--red); border-color:var(--red); }
.control-btn.share-on { color:#fff; background:var(--green); border-color:var(--green); }
.chat-stream { height:310px; overflow-y:auto; display:grid; gap:7px; padding-right:2px; }
.chat-msg { background:var(--soft); border-radius:8px; padding:8px 9px; font-size:11px; line-height:1.55; }
.chat-msg.me { border-left:3px solid var(--blue); }
.prejoin { max-width:720px; margin:24px auto; text-align:center; }
.prejoin-preview { margin-top:16px; min-height:220px; border-radius:12px; background:#0f172a; color:#cbd5e1; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex-direction:column; gap:7px; }
.gen-toolbar { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; margin-bottom:12px; }
.clinical-callout { padding:10px 12px; border-radius:8px; border-left:4px solid var(--blue); background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--blue) 7%,var(--panel)); font-size:11px; line-height:1.6; }
@media (max-width:1100px) { .gen-layout,.video-shell{grid-template-columns:1fr}.ped-detail{position:static}.variant-meta{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)} }
@media (max-width:700px) { .pipeline{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);row-gap:12px}.video-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.variant-meta{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr} }

</style>
</head>
<body>
<!-- 로그인 -->
<div id="loginScreen" class="login-screen">
  <div class="login-card">
    <h1 class="login-title">🧬 RareLink</h1>
    <p class="login-sub">희귀질환 다학제 협진 플랫폼</p>
    <label class="login-label" for="doctorSelect">의료진 선택</label>
    <select id="doctorSelect" class="login-field" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')loginUser()">
      <option value="">의료진을 선택하세요</option>
      <option value="심가원">심가원 (신장내과 · 시연 계정)</option>
      <option value="이아연">이아연 (신경과 · 시연 계정)</option>
      <option value="하유진">하유진 (소아청소년과 유전·대사 · 시연 계정)</option>
    </select>
    <label class="login-label" for="passwordInput">비밀번호</label>
    <input id="passwordInput" class="login-field" type="password" placeholder="비밀번호 입력" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')loginUser()" />
    <p id="loginError" class="login-error"></p>
    <button id="loginBtn" onclick="loginUser()" class="btn btn-primary" style="width:100%;padding:12px;font-size:13px">로그인</button>
    <div class="login-hint">
      <strong>시연 안내</strong><br>
      계정마다 다른 진료과 의료진 역할로 접속됩니다. 노트북 여러 대에서 각각 로그인하면 협진 요청·의견·투표가 실시간으로 오갑니다.<br>
      모든 케이스는 교육용 가상 데이터이며 실제 환자 정보가 아닙니다.
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:14px;"><span class="fb-status" id="fbStatusIndicatorLogin">🟡 연결 확인 중...</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="mainApp" style="display:none;">
<div class="container">
  <div class="header">
    <div>
      <h1>🧬 RareLink · 희귀질환 통합 협진 플랫폼</h1>
      <p id="userInfo">-</p>
      <span class="fb-status" id="fbStatusIndicator">🟡 연결 확인 중...</span>
    </div>
    <div class="header-actions">
      <button id="inboxBadge" class="inbox-badge zero" onclick="goTab('home')">📨 받은 협진 요청 0건</button>
      <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="openCaseForm()">＋ 새 케이스 등록</button>
      <button class="btn" id="themeBtn" onclick="toggleTheme()">🌙 다크모드</button>
      <button class="btn" onclick="logout()">로그아웃</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="tab-nav" role="tablist">
    <button class="tab-btn active" data-tab="home" onclick="goTab('home')">🏠 내 협진</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="board" onclick="goTab('board')">🧩 케이스 보드</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="genetics" onclick="goTab('genetics')">🧬 유전체 · 가계도</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="video" onclick="goTab('video')">🎥 영상 협진</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="treatment" onclick="goTab('treatment')">🩺 치료 안전 · 패스포트</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="experts" onclick="goTab('experts')">👩‍⚕️ 전문가 찾기</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="mdt" onclick="goTab('mdt')">📅 다학제 회의</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="library" onclick="goTab('library')">📚 케이스 라이브러리</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="audit" onclick="goTab('audit')">🔐 열람 기록</button>
  </div>

  <!-- 탭 1: 내 협진 -->
  <div id="tab-home" class="tab-content active">
    <div id="clinicalDashboardSummary" style="margin-bottom:16px"></div>
    <div class="grid-4" id="homeStats"></div>
    <div class="grid-2" style="margin-top:16px">
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="card"><h3>📨 나에게 온 협진 요청 <span class="note" style="margin:0">긴급 24시간 · 일반 72시간 안에 회신</span></h3><div id="inboxList"></div></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>📤 내가 보낸 협진 요청</h3><div id="outboxList"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="card"><h3>📅 다가오는 다학제 회의</h3><div id="homeMdt"></div></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>✅ 내게 배정된 할 일</h3><div id="homeActions"></div></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>🕒 참여 케이스 최근 활동</h3><div id="homeFeed"></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 탭 2: 케이스 보드 -->
  <div id="tab-board" class="tab-content">
    <div class="board">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>협진 케이스 <button class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" onclick="openCaseForm()">＋ 등록</button></h3>
        <input id="caseSearch" class="field" placeholder="케이스 번호·증상·질환명 검색" oninput="renderCaseList()" />
        <div class="filter-row" id="caseFilters"></div>
        <div class="case-list" id="caseList"></div>
      </div>
      <div id="caseDetail">
        <div class="card">
          <div id="cdHead"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-grid">
          <div class="stack">
            <div class="card">
              <h3>🧬 증상 (표현형)</h3>
              <div class="chips" id="cdPhenos"></div>
              <div class="row" style="margin-top:10px">
                <input id="phenoInput" class="field grow" list="termList" placeholder="증상 추가 (예: 각막 소용돌이 혼탁)" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')addPheno()" />
                <button class="btn btn-sm" onclick="addPheno()">추가</button>
              </div>
              <p class="note">표준 증상 용어로 입력하면 아래 질환 매칭과 유사 케이스 검색에 바로 반영됩니다.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
              <h3>🗺 진단 여정 <span class="note" style="margin:0" id="cdOdysseyNote"></span></h3>
              <div id="cdJourney"></div>
              <h4 style="margin-top:14px">❌ 이미 배제된 진단</h4>
              <div id="cdExcluded"></div>
              <h4 style="margin-top:14px">🧪 주요 검사 결과 · 가족력</h4>
              <div id="cdTests"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="stack">
            <div class="card">
              <h3>🧩 감별진단 보드 <span class="note" style="margin:0">진료과별 가능성 판단과 근거를 한곳에 모읍니다</span></h3>
              <div id="cdCands"></div>
              <div class="row" style="margin-top:12px">
                <input id="candName" class="field grow" list="dxList" placeholder="후보 진단 추가" />
                <input id="candTest" class="field grow" placeholder="확인에 필요한 검사" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')addCandidate()" />
                <button class="btn btn-sm" onclick="addCandidate()">추가</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
              <h3>🔎 증상 기반 희귀질환 매칭 <span class="badge">참고용</span></h3>
              <div id="cdMatch"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-grid">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>💬 협진 토론</h3>
            <div class="thread" id="cdThread"></div>
            <div class="composer">
              <div class="row">
                <select id="postTag" class="field" style="width:auto">
                  <option>의견</option><option>질문</option><option value="검사">검사 결과</option><option>결론</option>
                </select>
                <span class="note" style="margin:0">@이름 으로 특정 의료진을 부를 수 있습니다</span>
              </div>
              <textarea id="postText" class="field" placeholder="의견, 검사 결과, 질문을 남기세요" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter'&&(event.ctrlKey||event.metaKey))addPost()"></textarea>
              <div class="row" style="justify-content:flex-end"><span class="note" style="margin:0">Ctrl+Enter 전송</span><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="addPost()">등록</button></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="stack">
            <div class="card">
              <h3>📨 이 케이스의 협진 요청</h3>
              <div id="cdConsults"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
              <h3>✅ 할 일 (액션 아이템)</h3>
              <div id="cdActions"></div>
              <div class="row" style="margin-top:10px">
                <input id="actText" class="field grow" placeholder="할 일 (예: GLA 유전자 검사 의뢰)" />
                <select id="actOwner" class="field" style="width:auto"></select>
                <input id="actDue" class="field" type="date" style="width:auto" />
                <button class="btn btn-sm" onclick="addAction()">추가</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>


  <!-- 유전체 공동 판독 · 가계도 -->
  <div id="tab-genetics" class="tab-content">
    <div class="gen-toolbar">
      <div><h2 style="margin:0;font-size:20px">🧬 유전체 공동 판독 · 연결형 가계도</h2><p class="note">변이 근거, 표현형 일치도, 가족 분리검사와 가계도를 현재 협진 케이스 기준으로 함께 검토합니다.</p></div>
      <div class="row"><button class="btn" onclick="goTab('board')">케이스로 돌아가기</button><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="goTab('video')">🎥 유전체 협진 시작</button></div>
    </div>
    <div class="gen-layout">
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="card"><h3>유전체 변이 목록 <span class="note" id="genCaseLabel" style="margin:0"></span></h3><div id="genVariantList"></div></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>가계도 <span class="note" style="margin:0">인물을 선택하면 가족력·표현형·유전자 상태를 확인합니다.</span></h3><div class="pedigree-wrap"><div class="pedigree-stage" id="pedigreeStage"></div></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="card ped-detail"><h3>선택 가족 구성원</h3><div id="pedigreeDetail"></div></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>공동 판독 체크포인트</h3><div id="genReviewTasks"></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 영상 협진 -->
  <div id="tab-video" class="tab-content">
    <div id="videoWorkspace"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- 통합 탭: 치료 안전 · 디지털 패스포트 -->
  <div id="tab-treatment" class="tab-content">
    <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:16px">
      <div class="case-head">
        <div style="flex:1;min-width:280px">
          <div class="row"><span class="badge b-lock">RareLink × RareCross 통합</span><span class="badge">교육·시연용</span></div>
          <h2 style="margin:8px 0 4px">🩺 치료 안전 · 협진 승인 · 디지털 패스포트</h2>
          <p style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;color:var(--muted)">선택한 희귀질환 케이스를 기준으로 새 처방의 장기 위험을 검토하고, 필요한 진료과 협진 승인과 환자 패스포트·전원 공유까지 이어집니다. 원본 RareCross의 시뮬레이션, 승인함, EMR 추출, 공유 토큰 기능을 그대로 유지했습니다.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="syncRareCrossCase(true)">현재 케이스 연결</button>
          <button class="btn" onclick="reloadRareCross()">도구 초기 화면</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="treatmentCaseContext" class="question-box" style="margin-top:12px"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card" style="padding:0;overflow:hidden">
      <iframe id="rarecrossFrame" title="RareLink 치료 안전 및 디지털 패스포트" style="display:block;width:100%;height:620px;border:0;background:var(--bg);transition:height .15s ease" loading="eager"></iframe>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 탭 3: 전문가 찾기 -->
  <div id="tab-experts" class="tab-content">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>👩‍⚕️ 기관을 넘어 희귀질환 전문가 찾기</h3>
      <div class="row">
        <input id="expertSearch" class="field grow" placeholder="질환·증상·진료과 검색 (예: 폼페병, 각막, 신장)" oninput="renderExperts()" />
        <select id="expertCase" class="field" style="width:auto" onchange="renderExperts()"></select>
      </div>
      <p class="note" id="expertNote"></p>
    </div>
    <div class="experts" id="expertList" style="margin-top:16px"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- 탭 4: 다학제 회의 -->
  <div id="tab-mdt" class="tab-content">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>📅 다학제 회의 (MDT) <button class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" onclick="openMdtForm()">＋ 회의 만들기</button></h3>
      <p class="note" style="margin-top:0">안건으로 올린 케이스의 증상, 감별진단 합의도, 남은 할 일을 회의 화면에서 바로 보고, 결론은 각 케이스 토론에 자동 기록됩니다.</p>
      <div id="mdtList"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 탭 5: 라이브러리 -->
  <div id="tab-library" class="tab-content">
    <div class="grid-4" id="libStats"></div>
    <div class="card" style="margin-top:16px">
      <h3>📚 확진 케이스 라이브러리 <span class="note" style="margin:0">확진까지의 핵심 단서가 다음 케이스의 매칭에 쓰입니다</span></h3>
      <input id="libSearch" class="field" placeholder="증상·질환명 검색" oninput="renderLibrary()" />
